s move onto the afterlife with the power of music therapy!\n\nAll of your clients have a story. Some are good, some are bad, but all of them are packed with emotion. It\u2019s up to you to use the power of music to help these lost souls move forward!\n\nTo help your patients, you\u2019ll have to play some music on your trusty jukebox! Point, click, and hold the left mouse button to play the right notes.\n\nAfter you\u2019re done\u2026why not explore your room a little? Sometimes, it\u2019s good to unwind and take a breather after such an emotional session.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ghost-jukebox"}